> **“Not sure what's wrong? Tell us what you've noticed and we'll help you work out the next step.”**

* Evidence that Okee properly investigates faults rather than guessing
* Clear explanation of what diagnostics actually means
* Reassurance that fault codes do not automatically mean parts need replacing
* Genuine customer reviews
