# CUSTOMER LANGUAGE TEST

Judge language according to the knowledge level of the persona.

Do not penalise specialist language merely because it is technical.

Penalise it when the customer needs to understand it to make a decision but the website fails to explain it.

Always compare:

### How the company describes the service

with:

### How the customer describes their problem

Where this difference creates friction, highlight it.

